<b>Matobai
Shuusaku</b>

00:00:58.820 --> 00:00:59.490
<b>Banryuu
Reoko</b>

00:00:58.820 --> 00:00:59.490
<b>Arabashiri
Souya</b>

00:00:58.820 --> 00:00:59.490
<b>Hazama
Zetsubi</b>

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:53.000
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:11.150
Good grief, what a pain in the ass.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.930
This is what you call "a grown-up flavor."

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:25.790
Now, Kogane!

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:31.580
I'm never gonna let you get away with this!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:43.660
We did it... We did it.

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:47.390
Let's go. Oubu is waiting.

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:07.700
A-chan!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.620
A-chan, are you okay?

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.080
Kogane-chan...

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:14.290
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:16.530
You, too, Kogane-chan!

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:21.380
Hey, come on... Cut it out...

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.980
Wh-What are you two doing?!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:25.770
<i>This</i> is no place for <i>that</i>!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.180
A hug's just a greeting
elsewhere in the world.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.290
Th-This isn't...

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:38.150
Oh, that's right. You've been out 
of the country all this time.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.060
Kids these days are out of control!

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.660
He grew up outside Japan,

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.360
Thank you for helping me.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:46.450
so why don't we overlook this one, Kinoa-san?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.410
"Hey!"

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.920
"I wasn't helping you!" 
That's what it's saying.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:59.060
Oh... Well, I still wanted to say thanks.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:00.800
Tell me one thing.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.180
Are Bubuki alive?

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:06.130
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:08.510
Would you quit yammering already?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.780
Get over here.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.940
It's just bones. This can't be good, can it?

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.740
It's a skeleton. Is it malnourished?

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.030
Get real.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.190
I can't see Mom with this...

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.030
Huh?

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.250
Hand over your Bubuki.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:27.600
Huh?

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.880
I said, give me the heart.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:31.790
I can't just hand you my heart.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:34.060
Just shut up and give it to me.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.540
I can use the heart better than you can.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:41.000
How can you use my heart better than I can?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.340
Are you all right?

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:45.940
Cut the crap! Are you screwing with me?!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:49.890
Hang on, Hii-kun! I don't think 
you two are on the same page!

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.270
What?

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:55.140
A-chan didn't even know 
anything about Bubuki.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:59.770
You have something like this too, don't you?

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.460
No, I don't.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.740
Wh-What?!

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.240
Oh, man! I didn't want to believe it!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.910
He's not the one with the heart?

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.380
We're outta here, then.
And after we made it this far...

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.920
No. If we blow this chance,
we won't get another.

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:21.250
It's been ten years since you fell down here.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.880
Don't think everyone will believe you're 
clueless just because you've been overseas.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.490
But I really don't know anything.

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.740
I had never seen a Bubuki before today.

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:31.630
That's enough.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.430
Hey! Hii-kun!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.230
Bubuki react when their user is in danger.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.860
Quit hiding it! Show me!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.320
Stop it!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.110
What good will it do for you two to fight?!

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:47.950
A-chan!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:51.950
Y-You!

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:52.970
Kogane-chan!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.870
Good <i>grief</i>...

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:05.420
Did you think a piss-ant punch 
like that could beat me?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.260
Kogane!

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:14.210
Were you giddy because you 
thought you'd avenged your old man?

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.940
You were, weren't you?

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:21.900
Did that little game make you 
think you had a little talent?

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.400
I like that look.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.730
Righty-chan!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:32.550
Watch closely this time

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:35.700
as your precious Righty-chan dies.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.330
I won't let you do that!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:40.830
Oh?

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.840
A brat who can barely stay 
on his feet is gonna...

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.530
No! A-chan, run!

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.840
Your mother was a criminal 
who ruined the world.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.280
You're going to pay for her crime...

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.040
With your life.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:02.860
A-chan!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:10.900
You've got that pet of yours trained well.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:15.620
But it's time to say goodbye 
to your owner, pet!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.830
I'll blow you to pieces.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.580
Stop!

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:44.190
Th-That's...

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.030
Well, look at that!
He <i>can</i> do it, if he tries!

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:07.090
What a pretty heart...

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:13.090
Righty-chan? Righty-chan?

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:20.010
Righty-chan!

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:56.360
What is that?

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.810
I-I know that thing.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:12.820
It's a part of the thing that 
razed Ueno to the ground long ago!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.910
Awesome!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.580
Yahoo!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.910
Pretty good.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.680
Hmph. Small fry.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:49.570
Serves you right, dogs of Reoko!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:50.570
Stop!

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.220
Don't use my mom's Oubu 
to do things like this!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:54.650
Your name's Hiiragi, right?

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.020
Why are you doing this?!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:00.410
Hey, your name's Azuma, right?

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.240
If you won't be reliable, 
like a heart should be,

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.460
then we're just gonna do as we please.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:10.500
I mean, I personally think it's 
easier to do things our way.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.930
I should be... like a heart?

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.050
And just about on schedule...

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:26.210
You asked me why I'm doing this, right?

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.330
Let me tell you why.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:31.780
It's all to lure that thing to us.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:47.650
A red Buranki?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.360
There you are, Banryuu Reoko.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:56.760
Welcome back,

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.320
children of Migiwa.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:05.060
<b>Episode 2
Fire Titan</b>

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.560
<b><i>Bubuki/Buranki</i></b>

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:12.940
Let's go!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:17.440
We're gonna destroy Entei and 
prove that Reoko is evil!

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.070
Don't be scared!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:25.550
Entei lost its arms and legs 
in the battle 24 years ago.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.700
So it shouldn't be able 
to produce its true power!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.120
What the heck? This is totally gonna work!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:45.800
Yeah!

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:49.370
Reoko! You're a Bubuki user like us,

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:52.190
but you betrayed all Bubuki users!

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:55.900
Thanks to you, all Bubuki 
users are treated as rebels!

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.690
You're the real witch!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:03.920
It's your fault my dad went crazy!

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:07.370
You took away my dad's 
pride as a Bubuki user!

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:10.790
So I'm going to take back his pride!

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:14.460
I will crush the regime that you've created!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.220
I will take back the truth that you buried!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.960
I will... I will...

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:23.880
I will!

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.520
The truth?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:32.640
So you want to dig up this truth from its
grave, along with that Buranki's skeleton?

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:37.650
Then I'll turn you all into skeletons,
just like Oubu!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:43.430
May your internal organs boil away!

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.910
Oh, boy. Those brats are toast.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.950
Damn it... It shouldn't 
be at full strength.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:15.020
The crimes committed by Kazuki 
Migiwa will never disappear!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.520
Who are you?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.070
How do you know my mom?

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:24.820
I thought as much.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.910
You have the same eyes 
as that woman I detest.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.530
It makes me sick!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:15.560
Kogane-chan...

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.610
Kogane-chan, hang in there.

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:20.680
We finally found you.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.380
Kino-chan...

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.660
Hey, we found them.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.720
Well? What do we do now, Leader?

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:38.380
I dunno. Don't ask me.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.600
What was that?

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.050
Damn it! Why did this happen?

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:45.050
If you guys would've just 
shut up and done as I said,

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:47.540
my Oubu wouldn't have lost to Entei!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:50.110
What?! Are you saying it's our fault?!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:54.200
Yeah, that's right! You guys held me back!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.620
You're all useless!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:05.020
Don't take it out on your Bubuki.

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:07.670
What? They're just tools.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.820
They don't talk, and they don't feel pain.

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:12.260
I told you to stop it!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:15.560
Why don't I kick your ass instead, then?!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.940
Very funny! Just try it!

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:20.060
Hii-kun, Kino-chan! Stop it!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.020
This is no time to be 
fighting with each other!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.350
Kogane...

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:27.740
You're right. I'll stop.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.780
Right after I clock this bastard good!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.080
Entei?!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:41.120
Son of Migiwa, I have good news for you.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.340
For the first time in ten years,

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.380
a Buranki has fallen from 
the Buranki nest in the sky.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.670
And that means

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:54.780
the one who kept the Buranki from 
falling down to Earth for ten years,

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:58.680
your mother, Kazuki Migiwa, is dead.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.810
A-chan...

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.860
Kazuki Migiwa is...

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.450
Migiwa must be lonely all by herself.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:10.610
You should go and be with her right away!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.910
That's intense firepower. 
We're not gonna last.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.230
If I have to die,

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:21.390
at least fry me up so I look tasty!

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.290
You'll be burned up in an instant.

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:26.790
I'm sorry it turned out this way.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.230
If I hadn't asked you to come...

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:33.330
I'm sorry. I'm sorry...

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.560
Thanks, Kogane-chan.

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:41.430
A-chan?

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.790
My mom isn't dead.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:48.150
If she were, a lot more than
one Buranki would be falling.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.400
Oh?

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.620
People all over the world 
call my mom a witch.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.320
But she's not a witch!

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:01.430
She's still working hard by 
herself on Treasure Island.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.000
She's protecting this world.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.840
So now it's my turn to go up 
to Treasure Island on Oubu

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.670
and protect my mom!

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:13.170
That's a poor line from someone
about to be roasted alive!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.300
I won't die.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.390
No, we won't die!

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:23.020
Kogane-chan, and all of you...

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.620
None of you ever called my mom a witch.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.750
That truly made me happy.

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:31.530
Thank you.

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:35.030
Bubuki, the limbs of a Buranki...

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:38.010
And I have its heart.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.170
I need all of your help!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:43.500
Entrust all of your Bubuki to me!

00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:45.460
Because I have its heart!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:52.670
A-chan... I... I...

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.410
All right! I'm a woman, too! I'm in!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.970
Okay, if we can start as friends...

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.560
Who would give you—

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:05.380
Shut your mouth, you <i>guy</i>!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:09.050
Oubu!

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:28.120
Any of Kazuki blood who try to 
wrong Banryuu Reoko and Entei

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.370
will be eradicated!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.380
We're no match for them.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:49.560
Still no good?

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:06.970
Are our powers having no effect at all?

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:07.870
No!

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.320
If all five us try to move it separately,

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.830
we can't beat even a lone enemy!

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:15.130
So we have to move it with one united will!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.090
Right foot!

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:19.840
R-Right!

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.930
Left foot!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.680
Don't shout orders like you're the boss!

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.600
Left hand!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:26.620
Oh yeah!

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:29.270
Right hand!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.400
Yes!

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:33.240
Time to fly, Righty-chan!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.860
We did it!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.400
We're not done!

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:31.900
I'm heading out to clean up a 
Buranki that Entei took down.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:33.210
Get me a train.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.250
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.420
What will we do with the children?

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.820
Leave them.

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:40.230
Once I've cleaned up the fallen Buranki,

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:44.050
I'll just kill them along with Kazuki Migiwa.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.020
Reoko-sama?

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:54.100
Reoko-sama! Reoko-sama!

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:58.330
Hey, Heart!

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.030
C'mon, we've gotta scram!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:04.510
The one of Kazuki blood who inherits 
the Bubuki's heart, huh...

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.470
How is Reoko-sama?

00:22:47.750 --> 00:22:50.460
Hey, good work out there, Senpai.

00:22:50.460 --> 00:22:54.640
Oubu gets stolen, those 
Bubuki user kids get away...

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:56.730
Really, that's fine work.

00:22:56.730 --> 00:23:00.220
I asked you how Reoko-sama is doing!

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:04.930
Not a thing has changed.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:08.650
Time remains stopped for Reoko-sama.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:13.340
She's still in the 16-year-old 
body she had 24 years ago.

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:17.450
What? You're not waiting for Reoko-sama?

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:19.900
I'll let you take care of Reoko-sama.

00:23:19.900 --> 00:23:22.580
I'm calling together the 
rest of the Four Gods. {B: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four_Heavenly_Kings though the term is used in a lot of anime, manga, and games that have four villains or sub-bosses or whatnot}{A: Yeah, I think Four Gods or even Four Generals is fine.}

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:27.010
Oubu was stolen, the Buranki fell...

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.560
Looks like things are 
about to get interesting!
